        <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Conservation That Starts in the Village.</h2>
        <div class="sec-actions">
          <a href="#initiatives" class="btn btn-forest">See the Programs <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href="#initiatives" class="btn btn-ghost">How We Work</a>
