      <p class="lead" data-rv style="--d:.08s">Most projects arrive with the plan already drawn. Ours start by walking the land with the people who live on it: where the peat dried out, where the coast is losing ground, which paths the patrol already walks. Three kinds of work carry most of our budget.</p>
